## English Summary (non-binding)

Pek.RDB is **dual-licensed**:

1. **Personal / non-commercial use — free.** Read, build, run, modify for
   personal study, research, evaluation, or private use, provided this
   license and copyright notices are kept.
2. **Commercial use — requires ONE of:**
   - **(A) a commercial license** from the copyright holder (see
     `COMMERCIAL.md`); or
   - **(B) releasing your derivative work under AGPL-3.0** — the *same*
     license, with complete corresponding source, triggered also when you
     merely let others use it over a network (§13), not only when you ship
     binaries. Switching to a more permissive license (MIT/Apache/BSD) or
     keeping it closed does **not** satisfy option B.

There is no third option: using it commercially while neither obtaining a
commercial license nor complying with AGPL-3.0 is unlicensed use.

Commercial use includes embedding into commercial products, offering paid or
lead-generating services (DBaaS/SaaS/hosting/API/managed operations), internal
production or business operations, and resale or distribution for
consideration.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT
SHALL THE AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING
FROM THE USE OF THE SOFTWARE.

The Chinese text above is the authoritative version; this English summary is
provided for convenience only.
